You've done this before.

1639
01:17:30.020 --> 01:17:32.230
- Yup! Easy.
- Same technique!

1640
01:17:32.314 --> 01:17:33.357
<i>Stand by.</i>

1641
01:17:33.440 --> 01:17:35.442
- I got this.
- You got this.

1642
01:17:35.525 --> 01:17:36.360
<i>Ready…</i>

1643
01:17:38.904 --> 01:17:40.072
Let's go, Eddie.

1644
01:17:51.958 --> 01:17:54.336
- Yes! That's what I wanna see!
- Yeah!

1645
01:17:54.419 --> 01:17:55.545
Yes, Eddie!

1646
01:17:56.505 --> 01:17:58.090
<i>He threw the ball so easily.</i>

1647
01:17:58.173 --> 01:18:00.050
<i>I knew I couldn't compete with him.</i>

1648
01:18:01.760 --> 01:18:04.137
{\an8}<i>Eddie was throwing the ball really well,</i>

1649
01:18:04.221 --> 01:18:07.766
{\an8}<i>and he's really just that strong,</i>
<i>and he never made any mistakes.</i>

1650
01:18:08.767 --> 01:18:12.270
{\an8}<i>So I just feel like it's gonna be a match</i>
<i>between me and Amotti.</i>

1651
01:18:18.026 --> 01:18:19.027
Oh no.

1652
01:18:19.111 --> 01:18:20.112
Come in closer.

1653
01:18:20.195 --> 01:18:21.863
No, no, find the spot that works for you.

1654
01:18:21.947 --> 01:18:23.323
- Take your time.
- Yeah, you're good.

1655
01:18:27.703 --> 01:18:29.329
{\an8}- Go, Amotti, come on!
- Take your time.

1656
01:18:30.372 --> 01:18:31.498
This is our chance, man.

1657
01:18:32.666 --> 01:18:34.126
<i>I think I failed twice.</i>

1658
01:18:34.209 --> 01:18:38.380
<i>That's when negative thoughts</i>
<i>started filling my head.</i>

1659
01:18:38.463 --> 01:18:40.090
- Don't let it shake you.
- Keep your nerve!

1660
01:18:40.173 --> 01:18:41.800
- Let's go!
- You got this.

1661
01:18:41.883 --> 01:18:43.343
Eddie, Amotti's gassing.

1662
01:18:43.427 --> 01:18:44.594
This is already…

1663
01:18:44.678 --> 01:18:46.638
- This is already at that.
- He's gassing.

1664
01:18:46.722 --> 01:18:47.723
{\an8}Yeah.

1665
01:18:47.806 --> 01:18:50.267
{\an8}You can swing it twice before throwing.

1666
01:21:03.608 --> 01:21:08.613
